1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,934
Unit two built the exponential series from the limit for e.

2
00:00:04,934 --> 00:00:06,158
Here it is at work.

3
00:00:06,158 --> 00:00:08,919
The white curve is e to the x.

4
00:00:08,919 --> 00:00:15,039
One term of the series is a flat line; two terms a straight line; three a parabola.

5
00:00:15,039 --> 00:00:22,695
Each new term bends the yellow curve closer, and by six or seven terms it hugs e to the x across the whole picture.

